# EmbeddingGemma 2 video spike, CPU: the requirements.in environment plus video decoders.
# torchcodec is the decoder that transformers 5.19.0 (BaseVideoProcessor.fetch_videos) and
# sentence-transformers 6.1.0 (torchcodec VideoDecoder inputs) use. It loads FFmpeg shared libraries
# at run time (LD_LIBRARY_PATH; the pinned build comes from fetch_eg2_ffmpeg.sh, LGPL variant).
# PyAV and OpenCV bundle their own FFmpeg builds; they are compared as alternative decoders only.
